{"suttaId":"sn35.237","source":{"db":"E-Piṭaka (dhammanana/epitaka_app)","book":"S-iv","vriCode":"s0304m.mul","paras":[1147,1153],"vripara":"237"},"segments":{"sn35.237:0.3":"Dutiyahatthapādopamasuttaṃ","sn35.237:1.1":"“Hatthesu, bhikkhave, sati ādānanikkhepanaṃ hoti;","sn35.237:1.2":"pādesu sati abhikkamapaṭikkamo hoti;","sn35.237:1.3":"pabbesu sati samiñjanapasāraṇaṃ hoti;","sn35.237:1.4":"kucchismiṃ sati jighacchā pipāsā hoti.","sn35.237:1.5":"Evameva kho, bhikkhave, cakkhusmiṃ sati cakkhusamphassapaccayā uppajjati ajjhattaṃ sukhaṃ dukkhaṃ … pe … jivhāya sati … pe … manasmiṃ sati manosamphassapaccayā uppajjati ajjhattaṃ sukhaṃ dukkhaṃ … pe ….","sn35.237:2.1":"“Hatthesu, bhikkhave, asati ādānanikkhepanaṃ na hoti;","sn35.237:2.2":"pādesu asati abhikkamapaṭikkamo na hoti;","sn35.237:2.3":"pabbesu asati samiñjanapasāraṇaṃ na hoti;","sn35.237:2.4":"kucchismiṃ asati jighacchā pipāsā na hoti.","sn35.237:2.5":"Evameva kho, bhikkhave, cakkhusmiṃ asati cakkhusamphassapaccayā nuppajjati ajjhattaṃ sukhaṃ dukkhaṃ … pe … jivhāya asati jivhāsamphassapaccayā nuppajjati … pe … manasmiṃ asati manosamphassapaccayā nuppajjati ajjhattaṃ sukhaṃ dukkhan”ti.","sn35.237:2.8":"Dasamaṃ.","sn35.237:2.9":"Samuddavaggo aṭṭharasamo.","sn35.237:3.0":"Tassuddānaṃ –","sn35.237:3.1":"Dve samuddā bāḷisiko, khīrarukkhena koṭṭhiko;","sn35.237:3.3":"Kāmabhū udāyī ceva, ādittena ca aṭṭhamaṃ;","sn35.237:3.5":"Hatthapādūpamā dveti, vaggo tena pavuccatīti."},"attha":{"book":"Spk-iv","bookName":"Saḷāyatanavagga-aṭṭhakathā","vriCode":"s0304a.att","from":308,"to":311,"paras":[{"para":308,"vripara":"236-237","refs":["sn35.237:1"],"lines":["236-237. Navame <b>hatthesu, bhikkhave, satī</b>ti hatthesu vijjamānesu.","Dasame <b>na hotī</b>ti vuccamāne bujjhanakānaṃ ajjhāsayavasena vuttaṃ.","Dvīsupi cetesu vipākasukhadukkhameva dassetvā vaṭṭavivaṭṭaṃ kathitanti."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.237:1"],["sn35.237:1"],["sn35.237:1"]]},{"para":309,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Samuddavaggo niṭṭhito."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":310,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Āsīvisavaggo"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":311,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.237:1"],"lines":["Āsīvisopamasuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn35.237:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika":{"book":"Spk-t-iv","bookName":"Saḷāyatanavagga-ṭīkā","vriCode":"s0304t.tik","from":334,"to":338,"paras":[{"para":334,"vripara":"236-237","refs":["sn35.237:1"],"lines":["236-237. Navamaṃ “paññāyatī”ti vuccamāne bujjhanakānaṃ ajjhāsayavasena vuttanti āha –","<b>“dasame na hotīti vuccamāne”</b>tiādi.","Ettakameva hi dvinnaṃ suttānaṃ visesoti."],"lineRefs":[["sn35.237:1"],["sn35.237:1"],["sn35.237:1"]]},{"para":335,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Paṭhamahatthapādopamasuttādivaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":336,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Samuddavaggavaṇṇanā niṭṭhitā."],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":337,"vripara":null,"refs":[],"lines":["Āsīvisavaggo"],"lineRefs":[[]]},{"para":338,"vripara":null,"refs":["sn35.237:1"],"lines":["Āsīvisopamasuttavaṇṇanā"],"lineRefs":[["sn35.237:1"]]}],"wordLinks":[]},"tika2":null}
